{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9c5ed7f3-99d7-8dc2-bdff-9b96a7c8ad02",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T13:02:06-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:04-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:08-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, yeah, I want to report a pothole. It's at the intersection by my house, one oh nine Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:17-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one oh nine Rhode Island Avenue. Which intersection, do you know the cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:22-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, [pause] it's the corner right at the end of my block, where the stop sign is. I can't say the cross street, sorry, I'm on speakerphone, my hands are, uh, kind of dirty. It's the one right in front of the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:35-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I've got your address and the corner by the stop sign. How big is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:41-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across. No way it's smaller. And here's the thing, they patched it three times already. Every time it opens again, maybe a couple weeks and it's back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:51-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three patches and it keeps reopening. Okay, I'll note that so the crew knows it's a repeat spot and not a new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:59-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. [line breaks up] ...cars hit it hard, I hear it from the house. Sorry, did you hear me? I said I hear it from inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:08-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got that, you hear the cars hit it. Anything else about it, any water sitting in it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:14-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just the hole. It's deep on one side. Oh, and I have started throwing pottery on a wheel, so that's the dirty hands. Anyway, how long do repairs usually take? After I report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:25-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay. Usually it's a matter of days to a couple weeks, depending on how backed up the crews are. Late winter is busy with potholes, so it can run toward the longer side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:36-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so not tomorrow. No way, I understand. But if it's a real repair and not another patch, that would be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:43-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes, that you're asking for a lasting fix given the history. Do you want a callback number on the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:51-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four oh one, five five five, oh one seven seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:01:56-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven seven. Got it. It's in the system, Mr. Grasso."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:02:02-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you, Denise. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:02:04-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Bye now."
    }
  ],
